  id: neutron_capture
  displayName: Neutron Capture
  description: Soaks an element in neutrons until one turns into a proton, making
    the next element up. Slow mode (s-process) is cheap on power; Fast mode (r-process)
    is the only way to make Gold, Platinum, Iridium, Osmium and Europium.
